{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/3ab4c4490a4ce8e3ddf8113dd861aeb2.avif?t=1756392674\" width=396 height=127 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/94a6b128470eb3dc745d6cc5f88d01ea.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world shaped by Charlie\u2019s fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore magical places and meet quirky characters. Help them solve their strange problems through fun puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to carefully observe your surroundings and chat with the residents of Asfalia to uncover the mystery behind the missing puppies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dialogues are full of humor, wit, and cultural references, making the adventure just as enjoyable for older players. That\u2019s right\u2014Asfalia is for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.poster.avif?t=1756392674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.webm?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.mp4?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/56d0c0b6cd0c6f3a719731095702bc44.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asfalia is designed for children aged 7 and up, as well as adults curious to experience a humorous adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles are fun and easy to solve, and the intuitive controls make the game easy to pick up. Asfalia is fully playable with a mouse or a gamepad, and it\u2019s perfectly compatible with the Steam Deck. It\u2019s ideal for long trips with kids: a game that can be enjoyed anywhere, with ease!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/5adcdd0fc7c9215438961d4fa21d5c66.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a powerful storm, Charlie\u2019s puppies get scared and run into the forest. While trying to find them, Charlie ends up in a world where the stars have vanished. Can you uncover the mystery behind their disappearance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asfalia is a hand-painted world with a unique and enchanting style. It\u2019s a whimsical universe filled with adorable and mischievous characters, inspired by <i>Alice in Wonderland</i>, <i>Inside Out</i>, and <i>The Little Prince</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/39298d7392731562e9d5763b68bfa5e9.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheese-loving knife, a cleaning-obsessed marquis, an adventurous ghost... The world of Asfalia is packed with characters who are as silly as they are lovable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With professional voice acting in French and English, energetic performances, and a rich soundscape, you\u2019ll be immersed in a lively and charming adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/fc30eeae558a0da51941b97ad3a911f0.poster.avif?t=1756392674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/fc30eeae558a0da51941b97ad3a911f0.webm?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/fc30eeae558a0da51941b97ad3a911f0.mp4?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/a803e5e9f0b862f9971825a658e37688.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asfalia is bursting with lighthearted and delightful puzzles that are never too tricky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rebuild a cat statue? Take on the challenges of mischievous vultures? Find a way to restore courage to a frightened ghost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/7df08588f06c051fa15fb2b5cceff363.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with your environment to expand your sticker collection. Some of them are very well hidden... ;)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/08e9c7a0952c5e1363a3029feadaca0d.poster.avif?t=1756392674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/08e9c7a0952c5e1363a3029feadaca0d.webm?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/08e9c7a0952c5e1363a3029feadaca0d.mp4?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/2c6b1ee28c72240336a707710c83bd32.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In short, Asfalia is a world filled with charming and funny characters, wrapped in an engaging narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Asfalia: Panic at the Mansion\u00a0</i>is the second adventure in the Asfalia universe, following <i>Asfalia: The Cranky Volcano</i> \u2014 and more adventures are on the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant world awaits\u2026 Let\u2019s go to Asfalia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/0d48e9d01fe0c03fbcaf933483f3b92d.avif?t=1756392674\" width=396 height=127 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gotcha!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/33a44b272123253963548ef0756f771abca35118.jpg"},{"name":"Playful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/a29521432c1fcff862f9575386a2445499fa8a94.jpg"},{"name":"Good Girl!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/94a07e3ecfa58ed7058cd449ed9cb3f09589d753.jpg"},{"name":"She's Off Again.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/bae52dd9da52e5327aa3e77600337d1c30bdc495.jpg"},{"name":"Go Fetch !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/83ce1f291ecfa1048c26e682b52d406776f375ac.jpg"},{"name":"Pathfinder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/3d41ed5258ab92d6b7bbf1eb36a848a11a4de6c0.jpg"},{"name":"A Light of Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/45bb6e8f1b75ac3bcf117907db0d5ad86142ee7f.jpg"},{"name":"Smashing Pumpkin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/809527eb22fa270b1b1dd421024acfd7519f4c1d.jpg"},{"name":"Muffin Express","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/5d4d5ec67935799ab33079060f7673564f9cffaf.jpg"},{"name":"It's over 9000!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2436410/bc47160c300ec8ae172a5eedd8638722bba9df18.jpg"}],"total":36},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436410?t=1756392674","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2436410?t=1756392674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/d72d9356510bc58b9e3a3cd95478e5e59fc44031/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756392674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/d72d9356510bc58b9e3a3cd95478e5e59fc44031/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756392674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2485370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/3ab4c4490a4ce8e3ddf8113dd861aeb2.avif?t=1756392674\" width=396 height=127 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/94a6b128470eb3dc745d6cc5f88d01ea.avif?t=1756392674\" width=614 height=154 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world shaped by Charlie\u2019s fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore magical places and meet quirky characters. Help them solve their strange problems through fun puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll need to carefully observe your surroundings and chat with the residents of Asfalia to uncover the mystery behind the missing puppies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dialogues are full of humor, wit, and cultural references, making the adventure just as enjoyable for older players. That\u2019s right\u2014Asfalia is for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.poster.avif?t=1756392674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.webm?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/c8d250384315435faee710d2e59c85d6.mp4?t=1756392674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2436410/extras/56d0c0b6cd0c6f3a719731095702bc44.avif?t=1756392674\" width